# linux-flatpak-releases

Releases **Flatpak** publiques pour **toutes** les apps Linux Mr-Aurevo-X (pas de sources).  
Apps actuelles : **Crypto Tracker** + **Gest Linux Pro** + **Hub Utilitaires** (ne pas retirer une app de ce README).

Canal natif (Crypto Tracker zips) : https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/linux-releases — **Gest + Kit : Flatpak uniquement**

| App | Dernier tag | Paquet |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Crypto Tracker** | [`crypto-tracker-v@CT_VERSION@`](https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/linux-flatpak-releases/releases/tag/crypto-tracker-v@CT_VERSION@) | `org.mraurevox.CryptoTracker.flatpak` |
| **Gest Linux Pro** | [`Gest_Linux_Pro-v@GEST_VERSION@`](https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/linux-flatpak-releases/releases/tag/Gest_Linux_Pro-v@GEST_VERSION@) | `org.mraurevox.GestLinuxPro.flatpak` |
| **Hub Utilitaires** | [`Hub-Utilitaires-v@KIT_VERSION@`](https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/linux-flatpak-releases/releases/tag/Hub-Utilitaires-v@KIT_VERSION@) | `org.mraurevox.HubUtilitaires.flatpak` |

## Crypto Tracker @CT_VERSION@

```bash
curl -fL -o org.mraurevox.CryptoTracker.flatpak \
  https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/linux-flatpak-releases/releases/download/crypto-tracker-v@CT_VERSION@/org.mraurevox.CryptoTracker.flatpak
flatpak install --user -y ./org.mraurevox.CryptoTracker.flatpak
flatpak run org.mraurevox.CryptoTracker
```

Prérequis : [Flatpak](https://flatpak.org/setup/) + Flathub + runtime Freedesktop 25.08.  
Données : `~/.local/share/crypto-tracker/`

